{"id":"c056f7fa0375bc62","group":"92","path":"92/92-thm-smullyan-syntax-arithmetization.md","title":"Theorem-Code Sets of the Book Are Sigma-1","display":"thm-smullyan-syntax-arithmetization — Theorem-Code Sets of the Book Are Sigma-1","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-thm-smullyan-syntax-arithmetization","aliases":["92-thm-smullyan-syntax-arithmetization"],"display":"thm-smullyan-syntax-arithmetization — Theorem-Code Sets of the Book Are Sigma-1","source":"第 III 章 pp. 33–36，Proposition 3；第 IV 章 pp. 44、49、53–55（PDF 50–53、61、66、70–72）","source_status":"原书内容的显式重构","depends_on":["[[92-df-smullyan-proof-code]]","[[92-df-smullyan-base-parts]]","[[92-thm-smullyan-sigma-collapse]]","[[92-df-smullyan-arithmetic-classes]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-thm-smullyan-syntax-arithmetization"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-thm-smullyan-syntax-arithmetization</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-smullyan-syntax-arithmetization — Theorem-Code Sets of the Book Are Sigma-1"},{"key":"source","html":"第 III 章 pp. 33–36，Proposition 3；第 IV 章 pp. 44、49、53–55（PDF 50–53、61、66、70–72）"},{"key":"source_status","html":"原书内容的显式重构"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"7a63648901cbcd33\" href=\"?note=7a63648901cbcd33\" title=\"92-df-smullyan-proof-code\">92-df-smullyan-proof-code</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"f990aa46292ead55\" href=\"?note=f990aa46292ead55\" title=\"92-df-smullyan-base-parts\">92-df-smullyan-base-parts</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"08d7841178f7293b\" href=\"?note=08d7841178f7293b\" title=\"92-thm-smullyan-sigma-collapse\">92-thm-smullyan-sigma-collapse</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"9a375244351119bb\" href=\"?note=9a375244351119bb\" title=\"92-df-smullyan-arithmetic-classes\">92-df-smullyan-arithmetic-classes</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\\in\\{\\mathrm{PE}_E,\\mathrm{PA}_A\\}\">\\(S\\in\\{\\mathrm{PE}_E,\\mathrm{PA}_A\\}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P_S^\\#,R_S^\\#\\subseteq\\mathbb N\">\\(P_S^\\#,R_S^\\#\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\)</span> 采用原书规范编号与 # 证明序列。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal R_E^{1,1}\">\\(\\mathcal R_E^{1,1}\\)</span> 为上一节点的无指数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_1\">\\(\\Sigma_1\\)</span> 集类。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}smullyan\\text{-}syntax\\text{-}arithmetization}\\vdash\\quad\n\\forall S\\in\\{\\mathrm{PE}_E,\\mathrm{PA}_A\\}\\;\n(P_S^\\#\\in\\mathcal R_E^{1,1}\\land R_S^\\#\\in\\mathcal R_E^{1,1}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}smullyan\\text{-}syntax\\text{-}arithmetization}\\vdash\\quad\n\\forall S\\in\\{\\mathrm{PE}_E,\\mathrm{PA}_A\\}\\;\n(P_S^\\#\\in\\mathcal R_E^{1,1}\\land R_S^\\#\\in\\mathcal R_E^{1,1}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>证明链：变量、数码与固定造串图由素数底拼接/片段表达；项和公式由有限形成序列的存在表达；每行只需满足基础情形或从严格较早行形成。公理检验逐一拆十九个模式，保留 L5/L6 的全部出现检查、L7 的单出现替换和 N12 的包装检查。证明序列再加 MP/Gen 的严格先行条件，存在一个这样的有限序列即可表达 P。R 由否定造串图和 P 组合。</p>\n<p>这些公式只用 bounded 全称以及存在见证，故为正 Σ；Sigma collapse 给 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_1\">\\(\\Sigma_1\\)</span>。P.A. 的造项删掉指数分支、公理删 N10/N11，其余相同。原书 Appendix 还将语法条件 (1)–(15) 证明为 recursive（双侧 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_1\">\\(\\Sigma_1\\)</span>）；本定理没有错误声称 P、R 可判定，也没有把所有图关系都自动降为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_0\">\\(\\Sigma_0\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>原书对若干公理匹配细节留给读者；上述是数学层面的构造说明，未交付完整程序索引或证明助手实现。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-df-smullyan-proof-code","status":"resolved","id":"7a63648901cbcd33","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-smullyan-proof-code]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-smullyan-base-parts","status":"resolved","id":"f990aa46292ead55","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-smullyan-base-parts]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-thm-smullyan-sigma-collapse","status":"resolved","id":"08d7841178f7293b","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-thm-smullyan-sigma-collapse]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-smullyan-arithmetic-classes","status":"resolved","id":"9a375244351119bb","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-smullyan-arithmetic-classes]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"S\\in\\{\\mathrm{PE}_E,\\mathrm{PA}_A\\}","display":false},{"tex":"P_S^\\#,R_S^\\#\\subseteq\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal R_E^{1,1}","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma_1","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}smullyan\\text{-}syntax\\text{-}arithmetization}\\vdash\\quad\n\\forall S\\in\\{\\mathrm{PE}_E,\\mathrm{PA}_A\\}\\;\n(P_S^\\#\\in\\mathcal R_E^{1,1}\\land R_S^\\#\\in\\mathcal R_E^{1,1}).","display":true},{"tex":"\\Sigma_1","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma_1","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma_0","display":false}],"bytes":2065,"backlinks":[{"id":"af5c6b1bb1806001","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"原书 fm(x) 通过形成序列存在定义，并以界函数 π(x)=13^(x²+x+1)证明 recursive。本文的素数幂编码需要自己的解析论证；原书结果见 [[92-thm-smullyan-syntax-arithmetization]]，不把码像定义本身当成有效性证明。"},{"id":"4875a0c262fafe7c","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"原书 Arithmetic 表示在 L_E 中可表达，arithmetic 表示无指数可表达；二者与本地 PRArith 的“特征函数为 PR”定义不同。原书经过正 Σ 与 Σ₁ 合并得定理码集的 Σ₁ 性，详见 [[92-thm-smullyan-syntax-arithmetization]]；不能把任意算术集视为 PR 集。"},{"id":"2b8fcf92581114e5","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"原书从具体句法条件递次构造算术公式，最终得 PE/RE 的算术性。本文只生成外部码像；具体原书系统的可表达性已由 [[92-thm-smullyan-syntax-arithmetization]] 给出，不能对任意 X 自动成立。"},{"id":"baf256d78d60c2a6","anchor":"ref-41","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-df-smullyan-beta-function]] → [[92-thm-smullyan-beta-coding]] → [[92-thm-smullyan-exponent-sigma1]] → [[92-thm-smullyan-sigma-collapse]] → [[92-cor-smullyan-diagonal-closure]]、[[92-thm-smullyan-exponent-elimination]]、[[92-thm-smullyan-syntax-arithmetization]] → [[92-thm-smullyan-pa-semantic-incompleteness]]。"},{"id":"eed9e6920706b864","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"823a52c75bbad9bd","anchor":"ref-319","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-thm-smullyan-syntax-arithmetization]]"}],"outgoing":["7a63648901cbcd33","f990aa46292ead55","08d7841178f7293b","9a375244351119bb"]}